Well, there's a variety of different kinds of policy improvements, certainly that could be done. One way of improving long-term outcomes would be to make the funding of a broader range of evidence-based practices more routinely available. to individuals with a serious mental illness. I can take one particular practice as an example. This is the individual placement and support called IPS model of supported employment. Supported employment is an approach to helping people get and keep competitive jobs that places a priority on rapid job search to help people find jobs related to their areas of interest and then providing the ongoing supports in order to keep these jobs.
当然，我们可以进行各种各样的政策改进。改善长期结果的一种方法是，让患有严重精神疾病的个人能够更常规地获得更广泛的循证实践资助。我可以举一个具体的例子，这就是所谓的IPS支持性就业模式，即个人安置与支持模式。支持性就业是一种帮助人们获得并保持竞争性工作的途径，它优先考虑快速求职，以帮助人们找到与他们兴趣领域相关的工作，然后提供持续的支持以保持这些工作。

